{"product_id":"get-me-out-of-here-middle-school","title":"Get Me Out of Here! (Middle School)","description":"\u003cp\u003eProduct DescriptionHi I'm Rafe and this is my latest tale of middle school madness! I get to move to the Big City but we live in the world's dinkiest house. I'm accepted into an amazing school where all the kids are super-smart snobs. My first assignment is to create drawings based on my awesome life experiences but I can't think of one.About the AuthorJames Patterson is the CEO of J. Walter Thompson, an advertising agency in New York. He has written several successful fiction and nonfiction books, including The New York Times best seller The Day America Told the Truth.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 193\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: James Patterson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780099567547\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45677308608665,"sku":"5RC9780099567547","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/685ecf71d6280_Get_Me_Out_of_Here___Middle_School__James_Patterson.jpg?v=1756373501","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/get-me-out-of-here-middle-school","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}